# R8 full mode for release builds. The libraries ship their own keep rules (kotlinx.serialization
# for the Navigation 3 route keys, WorkManager for the workers, Room, Hilt, Tink, Apollo, Glance);
# the app needs none of its own beyond readable crash stack traces.
-keepattributes SourceFile,LineNumberTable
-renamesourcefileattribute SourceFile

# Glance finds a widget's placed instances by the class name of its GlanceAppWidget
# (GlanceAppWidgetManager.getGlanceIds). R8 merged the three widgets into one class, so every update
# of one widget redrew all of them with its own content (issue #18). Keeping them stops the merging
# and also keeps their names stable across releases, which Glance stores per receiver.
-keep class * extends androidx.glance.appwidget.GlanceAppWidget
